@startuml
title UC-00 - Sign In
autonumber
actor User
boundary AuthenticationController as API
control AuthenticationService as Service
database UserAccountRepository as UserRepo
control PasswordHasher as Hasher
database SessionRepository as SessionRepo

User -> API: SignIn(username, password) [MS-01]
API -> Service: SignIn(ctx, command)
Service -> UserRepo: FindActiveByUsername(username)
UserRepo --> Service: UserAccount
Service -> Hasher: Verify(password, passwordHash) [MS-02]
Hasher --> Service: valid
Service -> Service: Build identity context [MS-03]
Service -> SessionRepo: Save(tokenHash, user, expiry) [MS-04]
SessionRepo --> Service: Session
Service --> API: opaque session token
API --> User: Set HttpOnly cookie; open app [MS-05]
@enduml

@startuml
title UC-00 - Keycloak SSO (issue 77)
actor User
boundary Console
boundary Backend
control AuthenticationService as Auth
participant Keycloak
database Store
User -> Console: Sign in SSO
Console -> Backend: GET oidc/start
Backend -> Auth: BeginOIDC
Auth --> Backend: state, nonce, PKCE, browser binding
Backend --> User: transaction cookie + redirect
User -> Keycloak: Authorization Code + PKCE
Keycloak --> Backend: browser callback (code, state)
Backend -> Auth: CompleteOIDC(code, state, cookie)
Auth -> Keycloak: exchange code; verify signed ID token
Auth -> Store: upsert issuer/subject account; save session hash
Auth --> Backend: opaque session token
Backend --> Console: HttpOnly session cookie; redirect /ui/
Console -> Backend: protected API
Backend -> Auth: IdentityForToken
opt grant older than 30 seconds or expired
Auth -> Keycloak: refresh; verify subject and current client role
end
Auth --> Backend: trusted Organization and role
@enduml
